386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The studio was first created to help young adults and the youth to explore their artistic sides and experience the different mediums of art. Upcolor is defined by flexibility and independence of vision that enables us to work both internally and externally on the confines of the mainstream ideas of the arts. Our shared interest in examining the creative process in all of its variations and situating it within a larger critical perspective drives our work.)
/E (The studio was first created to help young adults and the youth to explore their artistic sides and experience the different mediums of art. Upcolor is defined by flexibility and independence of vision that enables us to work both internally and externally on the confines of the mainstream ideas of the arts. Our shared interest in examining the creative process in all of its variations and situating it within a larger critical perspective drives our work.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
